@* Phân trang dùng chung: chọn số dòng mỗi trang + danh sách trang rút gọn; giữ nguyên tham số lọc *@
@model IPagedList
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Extensions
@{
    string UrlFor(int page, int size)
    {
        var qb = new QueryBuilder();
        foreach (var kv in Context.Request.Query)
        {
            if (kv.Key.Equals("Page", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) || kv.Key.Equals("PageSize", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)) continue;
            foreach (var v in kv.Value) if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(v)) qb.Add(kv.Key, v!);
        }
        qb.Add("Page", page.ToString());
        qb.Add("PageSize", size.ToString());
        return Context.Request.PathBase + Context.Request.Path + qb.ToQueryString();
    }
    var page = Math.Clamp(Model.Page, 1, Math.Max(1, Model.TotalPages));
    var outOfRange = Model.Page > Math.Max(1, Model.TotalPages);
    var fromN = Model.TotalCount == 0 || outOfRange ? 0 : (Model.Page - 1) * Model.PageSize + 1;
    var toN = outOfRange ? 0 : Math.Min(Model.Page * Model.PageSize, Model.TotalCount);
    var pages = new List<int?>();
    for (var i = 1; i <= Model.TotalPages; i++)
    {
        if (i == 1 || i == Model.TotalPages || Math.Abs(i - page) <= 2) pages.Add(i);
        else if (pages.Count > 0 && pages[^1] != null) pages.Add(null);
    }
    var sizes = Paging.PageSizes.Contains(Model.PageSize) ? Paging.PageSizes : Paging.PageSizes.Append(Model.PageSize).OrderBy(x => x).ToArray();
}
<div class="pager-bar">
    <label class="pager-size small text-muted">
        Số dòng/trang
        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" onchange="location.href=this.value" aria-label="Số dòng/trang">
            @foreach (var s in sizes)
            {
                <option value="@UrlFor(1, s)" selected="@(s == Model.PageSize)">@s</option>
            }
        </select>
    </label>
    <span class="small text-muted text-nowrap">@fromN–@toN / @Model.TotalCount</span>
    @if (Model.TotalPages > 1)
    {
        <nav aria-label="Phân trang">
            <ul class="pagination pagination-sm mb-0">
                <li class="page-item @(page <= 1 ? "disabled" : "")"><a class="page-link" href="@UrlFor(page - 1, Model.PageSize)" aria-label="Trang trước">&laquo;</a></li>
                @foreach (var p in pages)
                {
                    if (p == null) { <li class="page-item disabled"><span class="page-link">…</span></li> }
                    else { <li class="page-item @(p == Model.Page ? "active" : "")"><a class="page-link" href="@UrlFor(p.Value, Model.PageSize)">@p</a></li> }
                }
                <li class="page-item @(page >= Model.TotalPages ? "disabled" : "")"><a class="page-link" href="@UrlFor(page + 1, Model.PageSize)" aria-label="Trang sau">&raquo;</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    }
</div>
